@startuml
title Data Flow — TelcoGuard

actor SourceSystem
database RawStorage
database ProcessedStorage
database Warehouse

SourceSystem -> RawStorage : Upload raw CSVs
RawStorage -> ProcessedStorage : ETL / Cleaning
ProcessedStorage -> Warehouse : Aggregation / Feature Stores
Warehouse -> ModelTraining : provide training data
ModelTraining -> ModelRegistry : save model
ModelRegistry -> Serving : provide model for inference
Serving -> Dashboard : show predictions

@enduml